0..75 Comment "// Rose trees: a node holds its children, in two forms. Written directly, a"
76..154 Comment "// node holds a `List` of nodes: the list\'s parameter is strictly positive, so"
155..233 Comment "// each child stands below the node and the family declares (#517). Written as"
234..308 Comment "// a block, a node holds a forest and a forest is empty or a tree before a"
309..385 Comment "// forest: the two families name each other, so they are one block, admitted"
386..464 Comment "// as one and sharing one stage; and the two measures name each other, so they"
465..542 Comment "// are one fixpoint over the sum of their domains, each measure that fixpoint"
543..622 Comment "// at its own summand. A call through either stands one stage below the node or"
623..691 Comment "// forest it was read from (Abel, _Termination checking with types_,"
692..767 Comment "// doi:10.1051/ita:2004015). The direct form\'s measure, recursing through a"
768..820 Comment "// list\'s map at its children\'s stage, is refused in"
821..872 Comment "// `../../pathological/data/rose.gandr` until #393."
874..946 Comment "// The naturals the measures count in, their addition, and the lists the"
947..976 Comment "// direct form nests through."
